@startuml cost-sequence
title 成本事件链路：明细 + outbox → MQ → 幂等累加 → 对账
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber

actor 客户端
participant "ChatController" as CC
participant "ChatService" as CS
participant "UsageService" as US
database "user_query_log" as LOG
database "mq_outbox" as OB
participant "OutboxPublisher\n(2s 扫描 + 租约)" as OP
queue "maibao.cost.queue\n(DLX → DLQ)" as MQ
participant "CostConsumer" as CON
participant "CostProcessor" as CP
database "cost_message_log" as DEDUP
database "cost_accounting" as ACC

客户端 -> CC : POST /api/chat
CC -> CS : chat(userId, model, prompt)
CS -> CS : adapter.chat()
CS -> US : record(..., SUCCESS)
US -> LOG : INSERT 明细\n（权威）
US -> OB : INSERT outbox\n（同事务，exchange=maibao.cost.exchange）
CS --> 客户端 : reply（不等成本）

OP -> OB : SELECT PENDING + CAS 抢租约
OP -> MQ : send(JSON bytes, persistent)
MQ -> CON : deliver（手动 ack）

CON -> CP : process(CostMessage)
CP -> DEDUP : INSERT 去重\n（REQUIRES_NEW，唯一键）
alt 新消息
  CP -> ACC : UPDATE 累加\n（事务外，避免间隙锁）
  CP --> CON : ok
  CON -> MQ : basicAck
  CON -> OB : markConsumed
else 重复投递
  DEDUP --> CP : 唯一键冲突
  CP --> CON : 抛出
  CON -> MQ : basicAck（跳过）
  CON -> OB : markConsumed
end

note over CP : 失败 → 撤销去重锚点 → 重投\n重试耗尽 → failed_task + outbox FAILED + DLQ
note over ACC : 每天 02:30：明细 SUM vs 聚合 SUM\n差异超阈值告警（只发现不自动修）
@enduml
